5. LIVE AUDIO VISUALIZATION BEHAVIOR IS CURRENTLY WRONG

The current implementation shows all audio bars across the composer at once.

That is not the behavior I want.

I want the visualization to behave like a time-based live stream.

Imagine the audio meter as a horizontal sequence of recorded moment samples.

Each new moment of microphone input creates one new bar.

That new bar should appear after the previous one.

Over time:

bar 1
→ bar 2
→ bar 3
→ bar 4
→ etc.

The user should visually feel the recording progressing across the composer.

